{"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Manual Integration"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Download-the-SDK","level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:"}]},{"syntax":"text","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You also need the "},{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" SDK, available from ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-apple-pay-provisioning-ios"},{"type":"text","text":". Download the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" (and "},{"code":"AdyenApplePayExtensionProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if you use a Wallet Extension)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","anchor":"Required-Frameworks","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning","level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All of the following frameworks are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for Apple Wallet provisioning:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Framework","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import in Code?"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provisioning logic and public API"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared types ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Internal secure communication","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apple Pay provisioning interface","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be embedded in your app for the SDK to function, but you should ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent"